---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Website Privacy | Incetekh Energy"
  description="How Incetekh Energy handles website browsing, Cloudflare Web Analytics and enquiries."
>
  <PageIntro
    reading
    eyebrow="Website information"
    title="Privacy, plainly."
    description="What happens when you browse this website or get in touch."
  />
  <div class="container reading-container privacy-copy section">
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="browsing-heading">
      <h2 id="browsing-heading">Browsing this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website has no account registration, advertising pixels or embedded
        social-media feeds. Fonts and project photographs are served with the
        site.
      </p>
      <p>
        The hosting provider may process technical request information, such as
        IP addresses, to deliver and protect the website.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="calculator-privacy-heading">
      <h2 id="calculator-privacy-heading">Solar planning calculator</h2>
      <p>
        The calculator runs in your browser. Bill inputs reach us only if you
        choose to attach preview context to a site-visit enquiry.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="prose"
      aria-labelledby="preview-privacy-heading"
      lang="en"
      translate="no"
    >
      <h2 id="preview-privacy-heading">Solar Preview (English feature)</h2>
      <p>
        When available, the preview keeps your bill, connection type and chosen
        language in this tab's session storage, valid for 30 minutes and cleared
        when the tab closes. Opening the property map connects your browser to
        Google Maps and Places; Google receives technical request information
        and your search or map interactions. A confirmed assessment sends your
        selected coordinates through our server to Google's Solar API.
      </p>
      <p>
        Solar results and layout stay temporary in browser memory. We do not
        save Google roof geometry, addresses or generation estimates in
        enquiries or staff emails. We do not send bills, precise locations or
        contact details to analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you explicitly choose to attach context, your enquiry and staff email
        include your bill, connection type, bill-based estimate/version,
        customer-selected coordinates, preferred contact and an internal journey
        reference. Enter your own location description. The reference does not
        save or restore a roof design. Ordinary enquiries work without this
        optional context; the enquiry retention and deletion terms below also
        apply to attached context.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google services are subject to the{' '}
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>{' '}
        and{' '}
        <a href="https://maps.google.com/help/terms_maps/">Google Maps terms</a>
        .
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="visit-privacy-heading">
      <h2 id="visit-privacy-heading">Online site-visit enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        When online requests are available and you submit the form, we store
        your name, phone number, optional email, location, selected plan and
        language in Cloudflare D1 so Incetekh can respond to your enquiry. We
        also store the submission time, a request reference and the privacy
        notice version. A receipt confirms an enquiry was saved, not a booked
        visit.
      </p>
      <p>
        The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile when enabled. Cloudflare processes
        technical information, including your IP address and browser signals, to
        check for automated abuse. This security processing is separate from
        website analytics and its EU exclusion. We do not send your form fields
        to Turnstile or analytics, or store them in browser storage.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact us by phone or email to ask about your enquiry or request
        correction or deletion of the details you shared. Please share only
        information needed to discuss your site and requirements.
      </p>
      <p data-enquiry-email>
        If internal email notifications are enabled, we also send these enquiry
        details and the request reference through Resend to Incetekh's Hostinger
        business mailbox so our team can follow up. A form receipt confirms
        storage of your enquiry; it does not confirm email delivery.
      </p>
      <p data-enquiry-retention>
        We normally keep an unconverted online enquiry for up to 12 months from
        submission to manage follow-up and enquiry history. Active follow-up
        normally ends after 90 days unless you ask us to continue. We review
        records regularly and remove details no longer needed, subject to legal
        retention requirements. Ongoing project, warranty or dispute records may
        need to be kept longer. You can ask us to stop follow-up or request
        deletion using the contact details below.
      </p>
      <a
        class="text-link"
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/"
      >
        Cloudflare Turnstile privacy information
      </a>
    </section>
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="analytics-heading">
      <h2 id="analytics-heading">Website analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics on incetekhenergy.com to understand
        visits and improve website performance. Cloudflare is configured not to
        add the analytics script for visitors in the European Union (EU). Where
        analytics is enabled, your browser sends usage and performance
        information to Cloudflare.
      </p>
      <p>
        This includes pages viewed, referring websites, browser and device type,
        operating system, country, and page-load and interaction timings.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare says its analytics uses no cookies or browser storage to
        track visitors and does not track individuals across websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare receives IP addresses when handling analytics requests but
        discards them without storing them in its analytics databases or logs.
        This is separate from hosting and security processing described above.
      </p>
      <div class="action-row">
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/dimensions/"
        >
          Analytics information collected
        </a>
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/speed/observatory/rum-beacon/"
        >
          Cloudflare analytics privacy information
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="enquiries-heading">
      <h2 id="enquiries-heading">Calls, email and WhatsApp enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Call links open your device’s calling app. They do not submit an online
        enquiry. Share only the details needed to discuss your site and
        requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        WhatsApp links open WhatsApp's website or app. Nothing is sent until you
        choose to send a message. Your use of WhatsApp is subject to its own
        privacy policy; this site does not embed its chat widget or tracking
        code.
      </p>
      <p>
        For questions about information you have shared with Incetekh Energy,
        contact us by phone or email. Email links open your email app; nothing
        is sent until you send it.
      </p>
      <div class="action-row">
        <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
          {site.email}
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>
          Call {site.phoneDisplay}
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .privacy-copy {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  section + section {
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
</style>
